{"id":"C8a43ff1f463ceda19a21","zh":"标准差","en":"standard deviation","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"用于表示随机量或样本偏离均值程度的统计量。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"标准差用于量化振动响应、接触应力等随机量的统计波动，并与均值或期望共同描述响应特征。在车体振动状态预测中，加速度标准差还可作为状态分类的目标指标。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C8a43ff1f463ceda19a21","zh":"标准差","en":"standard deviation","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"Hd02593f73ba5d8fcc99b","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · Wang等（2022）"}],"designations":[{"id":"Daf7a70face15331e99f2","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"标准差"},{"id":"Dd8dc395ea8323d474861","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"standard deviation"},{"id":"EMbd1ba6f14206a81003954fc5","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"标准差"},{"id":"EM01d00921856c92845fc9bd46","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"standard deviations"},{"id":"ED86fb8e19a02afaf939bfabe6","language":"zh","role":"variant","text":"标准差"},{"id":"EDdf66de8a37f7ea27b81761a9","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"standard deviations"}],"sources":{"P045":{"id":"P045","title":"Transient probabilistic solutions of stochastic oscillator with even nonlinearities by exponential polynomial closure method","authors":"K Wang, Z Zhu, L Xu","year":"2022","doi":"10.1177/1077546320987778","journal_citation":"Journal of Vibration and Control 28 (9-10), 1086-1094","label":"Wang等（2022）","overview_slug":"2022-transient-probabilistic-solutions-of-stochastic-oscillator-with-even-nonlinearities-by-exponential-p"},"P103":{"id":"P103","title":"轨道不平顺作用下铁路列车车体振动状态的PCA-SVM预测分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2014","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8361.2014.07.003","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-pca-svm-forecast-of-car-body-vibration-states-of-railway-locomotives-and-vehicles-under-the-action-o"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S451e992c35e813405893","source_id":"P045","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"en","text":"In this article, the PDF solution obtained by the EQL method is selected for b(u, t) and it should be calculated and updated for each time instant, which is shown as follows where μ1(t) and μ2(t), σ1(t) and σ2(t) are, respectively, the mean values and standard deviations of U1 and U2; ρ(t) is the correlation coefficient between U1 and U2.","citations":[{"source_id":"P045","page":3,"page_end":3}]},{"id":"S0ce7b81e62207d50c520","source_id":"P045","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"en","text":"The PDFs of U and _U at t = 0 are assumed as Gaussian distribution with μU(0) = 0, μ _Uð0Þ 1⁄4 0, σ2 Uð0Þ 1⁄4 0:02, and σ2 _Uð0Þ 1⁄4 0:02, where μ and σ denote the mean value and standard deviation, respectively.","citations":[{"source_id":"P045","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S0a41e27ddc5d9ad2b613","source_id":"P103","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"为快速预测铁路机车车辆在不平顺轨道上的的振动状态,根据车体振动加速度的3个评价指标(绝对峰值、标准差、绝对平均值),提出基于PCA-SVM方法的车体振动状态分类预测模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sa63fd65d8645e8368d99","source_id":"P103","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文基于朔黄铁路的轨检数据,以车体水平、垂向振动的不同状态为预测目标,将轨道不平顺的时间域和频率域统计参数作为车体振动不同状态指标(绝对峰值、标准差、绝对平均值)的控制因子和预测模型的输入,对不同状态下的轨道不平顺样本进行聚类,同时针对特征参数所表达的信息重叠与冗余,提出采用 PCA方法实现参数融合和信息优化,结合SVM法分类预测车体振动状态。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C7faa91e7f203494b6fcc","target_concept_id":"C7faa91e7f203494b6fcc","target_zh":"车体振动加速度","target_en":"car-body vibration acceleration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd60f0c6ceac02c34f1c5","target_concept_id":"Cd60f0c6ceac02c34f1c5","target_zh":"特征参数","target_en":"characteristic parameter","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C9f9d45ca78786436034c","target_concept_id":"C9f9d45ca78786436034c","target_zh":"相关系数","target_en":"correlation coefficient","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C679a89c39697e3bac429","target_concept_id":"C679a89c39697e3bac429","target_zh":"分类预测","target_en":"classified prediction","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C44255df984a4fc17fcbb","target_co